{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794597079580,"sessionID":"ses_e29b1d95affeG1NNpWx5iqRIiD","part":{"partID":"prt_1d6524443002BVrfHLQD2WhiCH","sessionID":"ses_e29b1d95affeG1NNpWx5iqRIiD","messageID":"msg_1d6522a120018P80X65lmL0to7","type":"tool","id":"call_afdbbb6f84ec4bf5a10fff4e","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"grep -rn -i \"no-edit\\|no edit\\|no changes\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/iterations/*.md | head -20; echo \"=== delta ===\"; grep -rn \"SA2-P2-002\" specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/*/deltas/*.jsonl | head -3"},"output":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/accuracy-runner-2/iterations/iteration-007.md:58:- No report of section-8 deferred items: the `run`-writes decision, the dsh install path, the sandboxed-runtime reach, the DSH `source` reach and the third no-edit pattern are untouched.\n=== delta ===\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/scorer-attach-2/deltas/iter-002.jsonl:1:{\"type\":\"iteration\",\"iteration\":2,\"mode\":\"review\",\"target_agent\":\"deep-review\",\"agent_definition_loaded\":true,\"resolved_route\":\"Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review\",\"run\":\"fanout-scorer-attach-2-1794570021136-noekp0\",\"status\":\"complete\",\"focus\":\"security\",\"dimensions\":[\"security\"],\"filesReviewed\":[\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:257-349\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/scorer/fusion.ts:675-680\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/handlers/advisor-status.ts:1-567\",\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts:1-748\"],\"findingsCount\":2,\"findingsSummary\":{\"P0\":0,\"P1\":0,\"P2\":2},\"findingsNew\":[\"SA2-P2-002\",\"SA2-P2-003\"],\"findingDetails\":[{\"id\":\"SA2-P2-002\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"iteration\":2,\"title\":\"NO_EDIT_REQUEST misses \\\"don't change\\\" and \\\"no changes\\\", so a writing command is still offered\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts:289\",\"findingClass\":\"security_policy_vocabulary_gap\",\"scopeProof\":\"NO_EDIT_REQUEST is declared in runtime/lib/command-attach.ts and consumed at :329 and fusion.ts:677,:881\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"hub command attachment\",\"scorer read-only lift\",\"hook briefs\"],\"claim\":\"The gate withholds a command on \\\"do not change anything yet\\\" but not on the two common paraphrases of the same instruction.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\"command-attach.ts:289\",\"command-attach.ts:329\",\"fusion.ts:677\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"pattern is byte-identical to base fusion.ts:675; every affected command is start or ask, so no silent write\",\"alternativeExplanation\":\"the vocabulary is deliberately narrow to avoid withholding on a sentence that also asks for a change\",\"finalSeverity\":\"P2\",\"confidence\":\"high\",\"downgradeTrigger\":\"withdraw if the pattern is widened elsewhere in this range\"},{\"id\":\"SA2-P2-003\",\"severity\":\"P2\",\"iteration\":2,\"title\":\"Privacy guard at advisor-status.vitest.ts:493 cannot fail because the fixture stores nothing private\",\"file\":\".skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts:493\",\"findingClass\":\"vacuous_privacy_assertion\",\"scopeProof\":\"the test lives in runtime/tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts and its subject is reached from advisor-status.ts:487\",\"affectedSurfaceHints\":[\"advisor_status output\",\"hook diagnostic read path\",\"holdout/privacy assurance\"],\"claim\":\"The assertion does not exercise the path that could leak.\",\"evidenceRefs\":[\"tests/handlers/advisor-status.vitest.ts:493-502\",\"handlers/advisor-status.ts:487-512\"],\"counterevidenceSought\":\"neighbouring test :537-564 proves t