 \"timeoutSeconds\": 900\n  },\n  \"mode\": \"review\",\n  \"reviewTarget\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build\",\n  \"reviewTargetType\": \"spec-folder\",\n  \"reviewDimensions\": [\n    \"correctness\",\n    \"security\",\n    \"traceability\",\n    \"maintainability\"\n  ],\n  \"reviewFocus\": \"Code review of command surfacing, PASS THREE confirming round. FIRST read the full instructions in /private/tmp/claude-501/-Users-michelkerkmeester-MEGA-Development-Skilled/c9fe91ef-9b85-4bdc-88fb-4d6f766eaecf/scratchpad/review-instructions-3b.txt and follow them exactly. Scope: commit 860610d783 and the two source files it changed. Say whether each of the two fixes holds and whether it introduced a defect. Every finding is P0, P1 or P2 with file:line and a concrete input you ran. Never open holdout-prompts.jsonl. Change no code, write only inside your lineage folder. This lineage reviews the doctor hook check fix first and deepest and the no-edit pattern fix once.\",\n  \"resource_map_present\": false,\n  \"resource_map\": {\n    \"emit\": false\n  },\n  \"severityThreshold\": \"P2\",\n  \"crossReference\": {\n    \"core\": [\n      \"spec_code\",\n      \"checklist_evidence\"\n    ],\n    \"overlay\": [\n      \"skill_agent\",\n      \"agent_cross_runtime\",\n      \"feature_catalog_code\",\n      \"playbook_capability\"\n    ]\n=== STATE first row ===\n{\"type\":\"config\",\"topic\":\"Command surfacing review pass three confirming round - hook-confirm-3b lineage (doctor hook check first and deepest, no-edit gate once)\",\"maxIterations\":3,\"generation\":1,\"timestamp\":\"2026-11-13T18:42:37.452Z\"}\n\n=== STRATEGY head ===\n---\ntitle: Deep Review Strategy - hook-confirm-3b\n---\n\n# Deep Review Strategy - hook-confirm-3b\n\n## 1. REVIEW CHARTER\n\n- Target: `specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build` (spec folder; review scope is commit `860610d783` and the two source files it changed plus their tests).\n- Lineage: `hook-confirm-3b`, session `fanout-hook-confirm-3b-1794595021404-69frey`, generation 1, lineage mode `new`.\n- Operator focus: confirm the pass-three fixes in commit `860610d783`; the doctor hook check is reviewed first and deepest, the no-edit pattern once.\n- Dimensions: correctness, security, traceability, maintainability.\n- Success criteria: every finding carries file:line and a concrete input the executor ran; no finding rests on inference alone.\n\n## 2. NON-GOALS\n\n- No code changes: the review target is read-only.\n- No re-litigation of pass-one and pass-two findings that are already closed; only the pass-three diff and its two source files are in scope.\n- No holdout prompt text: `holdout-prompts.jsonl` is never opened.\n- No repository tooling beyond the two named single test files and the hook check CLI.\n\n<!-- ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n## 3. REVIEW DIMENSIONS (remaining)\n- [ ] security\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:review-dimensions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n## 4. COMPLETED DIMENSIONS\n- [x] correctness\n- [x] traceability\n- [x] maintainability\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:completed-dimensions -->\n<!-- ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 5. RUNNING FINDINGS\n- P0 (Blockers): 0\n- P1 (Required): 1\n- P2 (Suggestions): 4\n- Resolved: 0\n\n<!-- /ANCHOR:running-findings -->\n## 6. STOP CONDITIONS\n\n- `maxIterations` = 3 or convergence (`newFindingsRatio` below 0.10) at the end of an iteration, whichever comes first.\n- A confirmed active P0 stops the verdict at FAIL regardless of convergence.\n- Three consecutive iteration errors would stop the loop; none are expected.\n\n## 7. SCOPE FILES\n\n| Area | Path |\n|------|------|\n| doctor-docs | `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs` |\n| doctor-docs | `.skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/tests/hook-wiring-check.test.cjs` |\n| advisor-runtime | `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/lib/command-attach.ts` |\n| advisor-runtime | `.skilled/skills/system-skill-advisor/runtime/tests/command-attach-guards.vitest.ts` |\n\n## 8. WHAT WORKED\n- Driving the real CLI against a settings root per command: `node .skilled/commands/doctor/scripts/hook-wiring-check.cjs --root <probe>` distinguishes the fix from a regression in one run, and the paired `printf '' | node - <script>` probe proves what node actually executes rather than what the reader assumes (iteration 1).\n- Reading the flag grammar from node's own behaviour (`node -rc /dev/null` -> `bad option`) instead of inferring it from the flag tables (iteration 1).\n- Running the same prompt through the pre-commit module extracted with `git show 860610d783^:...` and the current module: the before/after delta for a predicate change is measured, not asserted (iteration 2).\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"{\n  \"topic\": \"Command surfacing review pass three confirming round - hook-confirm-3b lineage (doctor hook check first and deepest, no-edit gate once)\",\n  \"sessionId\": \"fanout-hook-confirm-3b-1794595021404-69frey\",\n  \"parentSessionId\": null,\n  \"lineageMode\": \"new\",\n  \"generation\": 1,\n  \"continuedFromRun\": null,\n  \"migrationWindowEndsAt\": \"\",\n  \"maxIterations\": 3,\n  \"convergenceThreshold\": 0.1,\n  \"antiConvergence\": {\n    \"minIterations\": 2,\n    \"convergenceMode\": \"default\",\n    \"stopPolicy\": \"convergence\"\n  },\n  \"stopPolicy\": \"convergence\",\n  \"stuckThreshold\": 2,\n  \"maxDurationMinutes\": 120,\n  \"maxToolCallsPerIteration\": 12,\n  \"maxMinutesPerIteration\": 10,\n  \"progressiveSynthesis\": false,\n  \"specFolder\": \"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build\",\n  \"createdAt\": \"2026-11-13T18:42:04Z\",\n  \"status\": \"complete\",\n  \"releaseReadinessState\": \"in-progress\",\n  \"executionMode\": \"auto\",\n  \"executor\": {\n    \"kind\": \"cli-opencode\",\n    \"model\": \"opencode-go/deepseek-v4.1-fla