catorKind: \"transcript_path\"\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/017-review-pass-two-remediation/implementation-summary.md:167:<!-- ANCHOR:limitations -->\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/017-review-pass-two-remediation/implementation-summary.md:168:## Known Limitations\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/017-review-pass-two-remediation/implementation-summary.md:179:<!-- /ANCHOR:limitations -->\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/018-holdout-row-retirement/implementation-summary.md:137:<!-- ANCHOR:limitations -->\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/018-holdout-row-retirement/implementation-summary.md:138:## Known Limitations\nspecs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/018-holdout-row-retirement/implementation-summary.md:146:<!-- /ANCHOR:limitations -->\n=== 017 summary head ===\n---\ntitle: \"Implementation Summary: Phase 17: review-pass-two-remediation\"\ndescription: \"Built and verified on 2026-11-13. The 27 P2 findings of review pass two are fixed in nine worker lanes and one coordinator edit, plus four verifier follow-ups. Every floor equals its before line, the advisor suite rose from 1758 to 1796 passed tests and all 30 acceptance rows are Met. The changes sit uncommitted in the working tree on base commit ec1869dae8.\"\ntrigger_phrases:\n  - \"review pass two remediation implementation summary\"\nimportance_tier: \"normal\"\ncontextType: \"general\"\n_memory:\n  continuity:\n    packet_pointer: \"system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/017-review-pass-two-remediation\"\n    last_updated_at: \"2026-11-13T17:42:15Z\"\n    last_updated_by: \"claude\"\n    recent_action: \"Close