{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1794598109111,"sessionID":"ses_e29b1d95affeG1NNpWx5iqRIiD","part":{"partID":"prt_1d661f0e6002xQRezZmHqT2rUg","sessionID":"ses_e29b1d95affeG1NNpWx5iqRIiD","messageID":"msg_1d661c51c001ftMgOv5JhHoZ60","type":"tool","id":"call_c7af7774b9554454987f5140","tool":"shell","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"cd /Users/michelkerkmeester/worktrees/public/352-command-surfacing-research && L=specs/system-skill-advisor/routing-and-scoring/008-command-surfacing-build/review/lineages/hook-close-3c && node -e \"\nconst fs=require('fs');\nconst rows=fs.readFileSync('$L/deep-review-state.jsonl','utf8').trim().split('\\n').map(JSON.parse);\nconsole.log('rows',rows.length,'types',rows.map(r=>r.type).join(','));\nconst it=rows.filter(r=>r.type==='iteration');\nfor(const r of it){\n  const ok = r.mode==='review' && r.target_agent==='deep-review' && r.agent_definition_loaded===true && r.resolved_route==='Resolved route: mode=review target_agent=deep-review' && typeof r.newFindingsRatio==='number';\n  console.log('iter',r.iteration,'routeProof',ok,'findings',r.findingsCount,'ratio',r.newFindingsRatio);\n}\nconst c=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('$L/deep-review-config.json','utf8'));\nconsole.log('config status',c.status,'sessionId',c.sessionId);\nconst reg=JSON.parse(fs.readFileSync('$L/deep-review-findings-registry.json','utf8'));\nconsole.log('registry active',reg.openFindingsCount,'bySeverity',JSON.stringify(reg.findingsBySeverity));\nconst report=fs.readFileSync('$L/review-report.md','utf8');\nconst m=/\\\\\\`\\\\\\`\\\\\\`json\\\\n(\\\\{[\\\\s\\\\S]*?\\\\n\\\\})\\\\n\\\\\\`\\\\\\`\\\\\\`/.exec(report);\nconst packet=JSON.parse(m[1]);\nconsole.log('planning packet keys',Object.keys(packet).join(','),'triggered',packet.triggered,'verdict',packet.verdict);\nconsole.log('report sections', (report.match(/^## /gm)||[]).length);\n\"; echo \"=== dashboard findings ===\"; grep -nE \"P1|P2|Verdict|Convergence|Findings\" \"$L/deep-review-dashboard.md\" | head -15"},"output":"rows 5 types config,iteration,iteration,iteration,event\niter 1 routeProof true findings 2 ratio 1\niter 2 routeProof true findings 1 ratio 0.71\niter 3 routeProof true findings 0 ratio 0\nconfig status complete sessionId fanout-hook-close-3c-1794596804847-827gze\nregistry active 3 bySeverity {\"P0\":0,\"P1\":1,\"P2\":2}\nplanning packet keys triggered,verdict,hasAdvisories,activeFindings,remediationWorkstreams,specSeed,planSeed,findingClasses,affectedSurfacesSeed,fixCompletenessRequired triggered true verdict CONDITIONAL\nreport sections 11\n=== dashboard findings ===\n22:- Provisional Verdict: CONDITIONAL\n49:| P1 (Required) | 1 |\n50:| P2 (Suggestions) | 2 |\n57:| # | Focus | Dimensions | Ratio | P0/P1/P2 | Status |\n82:- graphConvergenceScore: 0.00\n91:- openFindings: 3\n94:- repeatedFindings (deprecated combined bucket): 0\n110:- Dimension: none remaining. - Focus area: synthesis. - Reason: correctness (iteration 1), security (iteration 2), traceability and maintainability (this iteration) are covered; iteration 3 adds no new finding, so `newFindingsRatio` is 0 and the loop converges at the iteration cap. - Rotation status: all four dimensions covered. - Blocked/productive carry-forward: no blocked approach; the active P1 and two P2s are carried to synthesis unchanged. - Required evidence: the reconciliation of the registry, the three iteration files and the review report at synthesis.\n115:- 1 active P1 finding(s) — required before release; not a P0 but still blocks PASS.\n","title":"shell","metadata":{"metadata":{"status":"completed","truncated":false,"exit":0},"content":[{"type":"text","text":"rows 5 types config,iteration,iteration,iteration,event\niter 1 routeProof true findings 2 ratio 1\niter 2 routeProof true findings 1 ratio 0.71\niter 3 routeProof true findings 0 ratio 0\nconfig status complete sessionId fanout-hook-close-3c-1794596804847-827gze\nregistry active 3 bySeverity {\"P0\":0,\"P1\":1,\"P2\":2}\nplanning packet keys trigge